& [Purpose]
  + implement SWA-06B1 as a pure provider-free verifier for one independently supplied review satisfaction signature and source-preservation record over an exact SWA-06A proposal
  + prove deterministic cryptographic and machine correspondence while refusing self-review self-signature policy laundering source substitution and activation laundering
  + stop at cryptographically_verified_awaiting_physical_activation without semantic-truth persistence or activation authority

& [ProfilesAndUpstream]
  + [SRA-001] revalidate the complete exact cantor-succeeding-sop-verification/0.1 receipt before any review processing
  + [SRA-002] profiles are cantor-succeeding-sop-reviewer-policy/0.1 cantor-succeeding-sop-source-preservation/0.1 cantor-succeeding-sop-review-payload/0.1 cantor-succeeding-sop-satisfaction-signature/0.1 cantor-succeeding-sop-review-admission-request/0.1 and cantor-succeeding-sop-review-admission-receipt/0.1
  + [SRA-003] every form uses deny-unknown-field closed deterministic JSON and one complete request contains the upstream receipt policy preservation record and signature envelope

& [ReviewerPolicyAndIndependence]
  + [SRA-004] policy status is externally_governed or synthetic_fixture_only and policy identity reviewer identity 32-byte uppercase-hex Ed25519 verifying key allowed proposal profile protocol UUID governance evidence and nonauthority are bounded exact fields
  + [SRA-005] reviewer identity differs from proposal author verifier proposal admission lifecycle plan objective selected step selected attempt predecessor SOP revision and every preservation identity
  + [SRA-006] policy-governance evidence contains one through thirty-two unique SemanticId values while policy supply and key possession remain distinct from proving policy governance semantic competence freshness or trust

& [SourcePreservationCorrespondence]
  + [SRA-007] preservation record carries exact identity source snapshot path subject source digest source byte count proposal digest immutable true preserved true one through thirty-two evidence refs and a domain-separated record digest
  + [SRA-008] path is repository-relative beneath source_documents has slash separators no empty dot dot-dot rooted drive backslash or control-bearing segment and ends in .sop
  + [SRA-009] preservation subject source digest source bytes and proposal digest exactly match the upstream proposal raw UTF-8 source without normalization

& [ReviewAndSatisfactionSignature]
  + [SRA-010] review payload carries exact policy reviewer proposal request proposal verification source author frontier preservation and review-evidence identities
  + [SRA-011] review decision is approved review checks exactly equal causal_lineage_reviewed source_intent_reviewed authority_boundary_reviewed unresolved_frontier_reviewed source_preservation_reviewed and activation_scope_reviewed and evidence contains one through sixty-four unique SemanticId values
  + [SRA-012] payload protocol UUID is exactly ad10f10f-d506-48ef-a805-f8b0a133766c and payload digest is domain-separated SHA-256 over the complete self-excluding canonical form
  + [SRA-013] signature envelope embeds the exact payload and one 64-byte uppercase-hex Ed25519 signature
  + [SRA-014] strict Ed25519 verification uses only the supplied policy key and exact canonical payload bytes and refuses wrong key payload mutation signature mutation noncanonical hex and policy-payload divergence
  + [SRA-015] production code contains no signing-key type seed generation sign operation secret persistence or signature issuance surface

& [AdmissionReceipt]
  + [SRA-016] success status is cryptographically_verified_awaiting_physical_activation and authority is review_signature_correspondence_only
  + [SRA-017] receipt records cryptographic_signature_verified true structural_reviewer_independence_verified true source_preservation_correspondence_verified true semantic_truth_proved false policy_governance_proved false physical_contact false and physical_activation_eligible false
  + [SRA-018] verified checks are the exact closed account upstream_replay policy_shape reviewer_separation preservation_correspondence review_payload_correspondence satisfaction_protocol signature_integrity authority_denial and deterministic_digests
  + [SRA-019] activation obligations exactly equal reacquire_and_verify_source_storage govern_activation_policy_separately assign_activation_recovery_owner persist_activation_registry_atomically preserve_supersession_and_rollback and never_self_activate
  + [SRA-020] receipt binds exact request policy preservation payload signature proposal and verification digests plus policy status and nonauthority

& [DigestsMachineFormsAndFaults]
  + [SRA-021] policy preservation payload request and receipt identities use separate domain-separated SHA-256 domains and every digest is lower-case canonical SHA-256
  + [SRA-022] request and receipt machine forms are bounded to 16777216 UTF-8 bytes reject unknown fields and replay byte-identically
  + [SRA-023] typed atomic faults cover profile upstream policy identity evidence preservation path review protocol signature authority correspondence digest bound and machine-form violations
  + [SRA-024] implementation is one safe cantor_core module one export one admit-or-verify stdin/stdout CLI focused semantic CLI static and evidence tests no dependency or lockfile delta and exact workspace quality attribution publication and replay gates

& [Acceptance]
  + [SRA-A01] source manifest input audit data design threat review seven-fold exhaustion canonical explosion justification matrix plan phase lock readiness review and formation signature bind exactly
  + [SRA-A02] deterministic success covers externally-governed-shaped and explicit synthetic-fixture policies exact upstream source preservation payload signature admission receipt and machine-form replay
  + [SRA-A03] adversarial coverage refuses author-reviewer collision wrong key signature and payload mutation proposal source frontier preservation-path protocol policy authority digest unknown-field and oversize faults
  + [SRA-A04] static inspection proves no unsafe signing-key filesystem environment clock child process network provider model activation output-path or physical-write surface
  + [SRA-A05] focused debug overflow-checked release warnings-denied Clippy format exact workspace recursive evidence local acceptance attribution publication and post-push replay pass

& [DualHemisphere]
  + semantic hemisphere preserves explicit independently attributed approval review checks evidence protocol source and unresolved frontier
  + physical hemisphere proves only Ed25519 integrity and supplied-data correspondence while denying policy governance semantic truth persistence and activation
  + convergence is one deterministic activation-admission receipt that remains physically ineligible

& [Delineation]
  + upstream replay structural reviewer separation source-preservation correspondence review payload correspondence Ed25519 verification digests strict machine forms and admission receipt are inside
  + performing review issuing a signature production policy governance source filesystem observation or write SOP persistence activation current-state selection recovery rollback workspace mutation commit push provider model remote FPGA Minecraft and external effects are outside

